  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Avoid TenSeconds/TenMinutes time scales in summary output by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/891\r\n* Tune HTTP/3 client performance by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/892\r\n* Add --worker-threads flag to set the runtime thread count by @ChrisJr404 in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/893\r\n* Update deps by @hatoo in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/894\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @ChrisJr404 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hatoo/oha/pull/893\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hatoo/oha/compare/v1.15.0...v1.16.0",
